      "writtenOn": "2021-06-17T16:57:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was thinking that increasing the Zephyr shell priority could create other issues. For example, the Zephyr logging and other functionality were implemented knowing that the Zephyr shell executes at the lowest priority. To mitigate potential issues, I thought it better to just run a select few EC console commands at the higher priority. But if everyone is okay with increasing the shell priority, we can just do that.",
      "parentUuid": "e2907132_775b5cb4",
      "revId": "a13191d58a6666e008e05747fd67dc967d8c5067",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
